      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Ravalli County Museum, housed in the old courthouse, chronicles indigenous history, the homestead era, and the valley’s ranching legacy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
